OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FMore than 2,000 people have crossed
OL,8,Fthe English Channel in small boats
OL,9,Fsince Andy Burnham became Prime
OL,10,FMinister.
OL,12,FThe latest figures show 326 migrants
OL,13,Farrived on Saturday in four boats,
OL,14,Fbringing the number up to 2,057 since
OL,15,FBurnham took over from Sir Keir
OL,16,FStarmer on July 20.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FThere were 1,962 crossings in the same
OL,8,Fperiod last year, with the total for
OL,9,Fthe year so far having dropped
OL,10,Fsignificantly compared with this time
OL,11,Fin 2025.
OL,13,FBurnham has said the government's plan
OL,14,Fto curb Channel crossings is working
OL,15,Fas numbers are down year-on-year,
OL,16,Fadding that the number of crossings is
OL,17,Fdown 50% this year compared with the
OL,18,Fsame period in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FThe PM added that July crossings were
OL,8,Fat their lowest in six years, but
OL,9,Fadmitted there is more to do.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham says more safe routes for
OL,12,Fasylum seekers are needed as well as
OL,13,Ftougher enforcement on Britain's
OL,14,Fborders
OL,16,FHe said previously that measures
OL,17,Fbrought in by Home Secretary Shabana
OL,18,FMahmood have "started to make a
OL,19,Fdifference".
OL,26,@zD@NOU{D@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FDuring a visit on Dover to tout a
OL,8,Fboost to the number of officers
OL,9,Fdeployed to tackle smuggling gangs,
OL,10,FBurnham said he wanted to "grip" the
OL,11,Fissue of small boat arrivals rather
OL,12,Fthen "play politics" with it.
OL,14,F"The public don't like the idea that
OL,15,Fthe border looks like it's not
OL,16,Fcontrolled," he said. "We need to
OL,17,Fbring back that control, but also we
OL,18,Fneed to offer support for people who
OL,19,Fgenuinely need it.
OL,26,@vD@AOUxD@WOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,F"Slowly but surely we are putting in
OL,8,Fplace those building blocks of a very
OL,9,Fdifferent approach to this issue. It's
OL,10,Fworking, but there's more to be done."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
