OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FWednesday marked the busiest day for
OL,8,Fsmall boat crossings across the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel so far this year, with
OL,10,F752 migrants arriving in the UK. The
OL,11,Fprovisional total for the year so far
OL,12,Fis 14,526.
OL,14,FThis is 43% lower than the number
OL,15,Frecorded by this time last year
OL,16,F(25,436) and down 14% on the same
OL,17,Fperiod in 2024 (16,903).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FThe Home Office notes that small boat
OL,8,Fcrossings fluctuate because of changes
OL,9,Fin the weather, with peaks in the
OL,10,Fwarmer summer months.
OL,12,FAt the same time, the government has
OL,13,Fannounced more National Crime Agency
OL,14,Fofficers are being deployed to crack
OL,15,Fdown on people smuggling than ever
OL,16,Fbefore, in efforts to curb illegal
OL,17,Fborder crossings.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30708
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FThe Home Secretary, who visited the
OL,8,FNCA's headquarters in Stratford on
OL,9,FSunday, announced that there are now
OL,10,Fnearly 800 officers in post, up from
OL,11,F376 officers at the start of 2025.
OL,13,FThese officers, working with
OL,14,Finternational partners, have seized
OL,15,F1109 small boats or engines since the
OL,16,F2024 election.
OL,18,FLast year, the NCA was involved in
OL,19,Falmost 300 arrests to disrupt gangs
OL,20,Fbringing migrants to the UK illegally.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30709
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FInvestment for the new officers comes
OL,8,Fas part of the over #280m funding for
OL,9,Fthe Border Security Command.
OL,11,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says
OL,12,Fthere have been 1,900 arrests of
OL,13,Fpeople smugglers, 1,100 boats and
OL,14,Fengines seized and 46,000 crossings
OL,15,Fdisrupted so far this year
OL,17,FAlthough removals are up 41% since
OL,18,FLabour took power in 2024, with more
OL,19,Fthan 70,000 deportations, she said the
OL,20,FGovernment "will go further" on this
OL,21,Fissue and acknowledged public concern.
OL,26,@|D@LOU|D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30710
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,F"I share their concern every time they
OL,8,Fsee images of people crossing the
OL,9,FChannel," Mahmood said.
OL,11,FAsked about why 2,000 people had
OL,12,Fcrossed the Channel in small boats
OL,13,Fsince Prime Minister Andy Burnham took
OL,14,Foffice on July 20, Ms Mahmood said the
OL,15,FNCA's work was having an "impact".
OL,17,F"That's why we're doubling the number
OL,18,Fof NCA officers because we know that
OL,19,Fthis is the work we need to do in
OL,20,Forder to secure our border," she said.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@IO]wD@ZOUwD@aO]yD@AOU|D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30711
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F307A1785714478
OL,3,CNumber of people crossing in small
OL,4,Cboats tops 2,000 since Andy Burnham
OL,5,Cbecame PM
OL,7,FMahmood added: "I've been absolutely
OL,8,Flaser-light focused on from the moment
OL,9,FI became the Home Secretary, taking
OL,10,Fall of the measures that I know are
OL,11,Fneeded in order to secure our border."
OL,13,FSince the 2024 election, nearly 70,000
OL,14,Fillegal migrants have been removed
OL,15,Ffrom the UK, and joint work with the
OL,16,FFrench has stopped over 46,000
OL,17,Fattempted Channel crossings.
OL,26,@oD@POUsD@fO]
